      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosendale_(CDP)%2C_New_York",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Rosendale trestle, once a railroad bridge, now serves as a pedestrian walkway across the Rondout Creek.",
